
 serve the docs on the port you forwarded


forward 8080


 🤖 Port 8080 is now forwarded to http://127.82.233.168:8080.


Serving the documentation start docs:8080 $ just docs


 🤖 Port 8080 now belongs to job docs.


The docs are served on the forwarded port.


 put the api and a bare forward on that port too


Running the api on that port start api:8080 $ just api ✗ could not forward port 8080 for job "api",…
forward 8080 ✗ port 8080 is already forwarded

Port 8080 already belongs to docs.
